From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ken Russell <kbr@chromium.org>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 13:14:36 -0700
Subject: GPU: add TexSubImage2D workaround for certain texture formats.

Add a workaround for a bug in the handling of texture uploads of
certain host-twiddled texture formats; use TexImage2D + TexSubImage2D
instead of uploading the data in the TexImage2D call. Apply this
workaround to PowerVR drivers.

Bug: 553172761
Change-Id: Ie28aa469e46a015927488176e8ceef0962056287
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8316468
Auto-Submit: Kenneth Russell <kbr@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Zhenyao Mo <zmo@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: vikas soni <vikassoni@chromium.org>
Commit-Queue: Zhenyao Mo <zmo@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1690048}

Electron adaptation notes (44-x-y):
The new gpu_driver_bug_list.json entry (id 494) is appended after the
entries this branch already carries instead of before them; the entry
content is verbatim.

